<mj-column>
<mj-text><p>You asked how long a new sending domain needs before it can carry a full send.</p></mj-text>
<mj-image src="/media/0193d7a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000000/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fwarmup-curve.webp" alt=""></mj-image>
<mj-text><p>Our answer: four weeks, starting with your most engaged readers.</p></mj-text>
</mj-column>
</mj-section>
